# ─── Real client data (PRIVATE — GDPR) ────────────────────────────────
# Per-tenant working files: class lists, contact details, rapport templates.
# This holds REAL personal data of minors and their parents. It was sitting
# untracked-but-not-ignored on 2026-08-10, i.e. one `git add -A` away from a
# public repo. Root-anchored so it cannot swallow an app route named Tenants/.
/Tenants/

# ─── Legal contract drafts (PRIVATE) ──────────────────────────────────
# Leading slash matters: unanchored `legal/` also swallowed app/legal/, the
# PUBLIC route that renders the privacy statement for visitors without an account.
/legal/

